	"skills": [],
	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "A7DKwqJovcQ8tFFqx",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 34, DX 8, IQ 0, HT 12, HP 104, WILL 0, PER 10, FP 12, SPEED 5, MOVE 1, DODGE 8, DR —. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "AQzqJ_Tq2Fy3jQvdT",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 132 (offense 44, protection 88), threat tier severe, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "Aqqt-qjdcYApoU-Uk",
			"text": "Engulf (Binding ST 24) (Constriction Attack, effective ST 24 (thrust 2d+1 crushing)), reach C: No attack roll and no active defense. No attack roll is necessary; the quarry may defend only by dodging and retreating. Moving through an SM+2 or smaller creature is an automatic slam. A victim who fails to dodge is pinned if smaller than the pudding, or grappled if equal or larger. Breaking free is a Quick Contest of ST (only every 10 seconds if pinned; on a 17 or 18 the victim cannot escape unaided); the pudding has +10 ST when pinning and +5 when grappling. Engulfed victims cannot breathe and begin to suffocate when out of breath. It can pin or grapple one foe at a time; others are pushed along in front of it unless they win a Quick Contest of ST. It may constrict an engulfed victim every turn at effective ST 24."
		},
		{
			"id": "AwWStPHr4rp8MKI2K",
			"text": "Acid (Corrosion Aura) (1d-1 corrosion per second), reach C: No attack roll and no active defense. Always on, no attack roll. Any organic or metal creature or object touching the pudding takes 1d-1 corrosion per second; stone is unaffected. Engulfed creatures and objects take it as large-area injury. Selective, so it does not destroy what the pudding is not attacking."
		},
		{
			"id": "AsTz1Y4mEiVwYCkhm",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/black-pudding.gct"
		},
